# .NET / Avalonia 编译、中间文件与本地产物（目录规则匹配任意层级）
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
bin-debug/
bin-release/
artifacts/
publish/
*.binlog
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
/packages/

